5
00:00:16,570 --> 00:00:21,443
I've spent years building AI products in Silicon Valley and at major technology

6
00:00:21,443 --> 00:00:26,562
companies, including ByteDance, and the pattern that shows up in every one of those

7
00:00:26,562 --> 00:00:31,742
jobs is the same one you'll meet in your own inbox this week: the boring, repeatable

8
00:00:31,742 --> 00:00:36,923
