17
00:01:11,909 --> 00:01:13,258
Ten artifacts in total.

18
00:01:13,258 --> 00:01:16,307
You will use the first one before this section ends.

19
00:01:16,307 --> 00:01:19,474
Threaded through the whole course is one running case.

20
00:01:19,474 --> 00:01:23,989
Priya Malhotra manages renewals at Calloway and Finch, a commercial insurance

21
00:01:23,989 --> 00:01:28,446
