25
00:01:39,236 --> 00:01:41,347
She is not the expert in this story.

26
00:01:41,347 --> 00:01:43,282
She is you, a few weeks from now.

27
00:01:43,832 --> 00:01:48,717
That is the whole course in one sentence, and we will come back to it constantly.

28
00:01:48,717 --> 00:01:53,422
You would never hand a brand new hire your whole inbox on their first morning.

29
00:01:53,422 --> 00:01:58,428
The same caution applies here, and it is the difference between people who get real

30
00:01:58,428 --> 00:02:02,650
